<title>USA: Clinton to attend EU summit at The Hague.</title>
<headline>Clinton to attend EU summit at The Hague.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton will participate in a summit with European Union leaders in the Netherlands in May, the White House said on Friday.</p>
<p>White House Press Secretary Mike McCurry said Clinton would meet with EU leaders for talks in the Hague on May 28-29. He was expected to visit other European countries during his trip, McCurry said.</p>
</text>
